{
  "declaredLength": 5516,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "인생에는 라이벌이 필요한 법!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C778C0DDC5D0B2940020B77CC774BC8CC7740020D544C694D55C0020BC950021002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맞아요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC544C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "괜찮으세요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD1CCC2EC73CC138C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇고말고!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807ACE0B9D0ACE0002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안 괜찮고말고!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5480020AD1CCC2EACE0B9D0ACE0002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너, 내 라이벌이 되어 주라!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108002C0020B0B40020B77CC774BC8CC7740020B418C5B40020C8FCB77C002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당황스러운 부탁이라는 건 잘 알아!\n그렇지만 우선 내 이야기를 들어 줘!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9D669C2A4B7ECC6B40020BD80D0C1C774B77CB2940020AC740020C7980020C54CC5440021000AADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020C6B0C1200020B0B40020C774C57CAE30B97C0020B4E4C5B40020C9180021002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "같은 날에 태어난 우리는\n같은 포켓몬인 카르본을 키우기 시작했다...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC19C7400020B0A0C5D00020D0DCC5B4B09C0020C6B0B9ACB294000AAC19C7400020D3ECCF13BAACC7780020CE74B974BCF8C7440020D0A4C6B0AE300020C2DCC791D588B2E4002E002E002E00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카르본은 도구에 따라\n2종류의 모습으로 진화를 하는 포켓몬!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B974BCF8C7400020B3C4AD6CC5D00020B530B77C000A0032C885B958C7580020BAA8C2B5C73CB85C0020C9C4D654B97C0020D558B2940020D3ECCF13BAAC002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만, 언제까지고 둘 다 카르본인 채로\n같은 길을 걸을 수는 없었다... 라이벌이니까.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC002C0020C5B8C81CAE4CC9C0ACE00020B4580020B2E40020CE74B974BCF8C7780020CC44B85C000AAC19C7400020AE38C7440020AC78C7440020C218B2940020C5C6C5C8B2E4002E002E002E0020B77CC774BC8CC774B2C8AE4C002E00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "한쪽은 카디나르마로,\n다른 한쪽은 파라블레이즈로,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n서로의 카르본을 진화시킨다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D55CCABDC7400020CE74B514B098B974B9C8B85C002C000AB2E4B9780020D55CCABDC7400020D30CB77CBE14B808C774C988B85C002C00100001BE00000AC11CB85CC7580020CE74B974BCF8C7440020C9C4D654C2DCD0A8B2E4002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리고 어느 날...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACACE00020C5B4B2900020B0A0002E002E002E00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "운명적인 재회를 한 우리는\n카디나르마와 파라블레이즈를 꺼내서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n자웅을 겨루게 된다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B4BA85C801C7780020C7ACD68CB97C0020D55C0020C6B0B9ACB294000ACE74B514B098B974B9C8C6400020D30CB77CBE14B808C774C988B97C0020AEBCB0B4C11C00100001BE00000AC790C6C5C7440020ACA8B8E8AC8C0020B41CB2E4002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이런 뜨거운 스토리를 꿈꿔 왔는데,\n나한테는 같은 날에 태어난 라이벌은커녕<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n친구조차 없단 말이야!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그러니까 네가 내 라이벌이 되어 주라!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "걱정하지 마! 카르본을 진화시킬\n축복받은갑옷과 저주받은갑옷은 있으니까.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC71C815D558C9C00020B9C800210020CE74B974BCF8C7440020C9C4D654C2DCD0AC000ACD95BCF5BC1BC740AC11C637ACFC0020C800C8FCBC1BC740AC11C637C7400020C788C73CB2C8AE4C002E00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "둘 중 하나는 너에게 줄게!\n그러니까 카르본을 진화시켜서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n꿈의 배틀을 할 수 있게 해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4580020C9110020D558B098B2940020B108C5D0AC8C0020C904AC8C0021000AADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C0020CE74B974BCF8C7440020C9C4D654C2DCCF1CC11C00100001BE00000AAFC8C7580020BC30D2C0C7440020D5600020C2180020C788AC8C0020D5740020C918002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 갑옷을 받을지 정했으면\n내게 말을 걸어 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020AC11C637C7440020BC1BC744C9C00020C815D588C73CBA74000AB0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 갑옷을 받을지 결정한 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020AC11C637C7440020BC1BC744C9C00020ACB0C815D55C0020AC70C57C003F00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "축복받은갑옷",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD95BCF5BC1BC740AC11C6370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저주받은갑옷",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C8FCBC1BC740AC11C6370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그만둔다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9CCB454B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너와 운명적인 결투를 할 수만 있다면\n얼마든지 고민해도 좋아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108C6400020C6B4BA85C801C7780020ACB0D22CB97C0020D5600020C218B9CC0020C788B2E4BA74000AC5BCB9C8B4E0C9C00020ACE0BBFCD574B3C40020C88BC544002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "축복받은갑옷...\n카디나르마로 진화시킬 거구나!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD95BCF5BC1BC740AC11C637002E002E002E000ACE74B514B098B974B9C8B85C0020C9C4D654C2DCD0AC0020AC70AD6CB098002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 나는 저주받은갑옷으로\n카르본을 파라블레이즈로 진화시킬게!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020B098B2940020C800C8FCBC1BC740AC11C637C73CB85C000ACE74B974BCF8C7440020D30CB77CBE14B808C774C988B85C0020C9C4D654C2DCD0ACAC8C002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가자, 카르본!\n창염의 힘을 이 손안에...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00C790002C0020CE74B974BCF80021000ACC3DC5FCC7580020D798C7440020C7740020C190C548C5D0002E002E002E002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이제 너의 카디나르마와 나의 파라블레이즈가\n1 대 1 승부를 하는 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C81C0020B108C7580020CE74B514B098B974B9C8C6400020B098C7580020D30CB77CBE14B808C774C988AC00000A00310020B300002000310020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558B2940020AC70C57C002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파라아!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CB77CC54400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저주받은갑옷...\n파라블레이즈로 진화시킬 거구나!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C8FCBC1BC740AC11C637002E002E002E000AD30CB77CBE14B808C774C988B85C0020C9C4D654C2DCD0AC0020AC70AD6CB098002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 나는 축복받은갑옷으로\n카르본을 카디나르마로 진화시킬게!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020B098B2940020CD95BCF5BC1BC740AC11C637C73CB85C000ACE74B974BCF8C7440020CE74B514B098B974B9C8B85C0020C9C4D654C2DCD0ACAC8C002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가자, 카르본!\n홍련의 힘을 이 손안에...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00C790002C0020CE74B974BCF80021000AD64DB828C7580020D798C7440020C7740020C190C548C5D0002E002E002E002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이제 너의 파라블레이즈와 나의 카디나르마가\n1 대 1 승부를 하는 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C81C0020B108C7580020D30CB77CBE14B808C774C988C6400020B098C7580020CE74B514B098B974B9C8AC00000A00310020B300002000310020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558B2940020AC70C57C002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카디이!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B514C77400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파라블레이즈와 카디나르마의\n운명적인 결투를 시작해 볼까?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CB77CBE14B808C774C988C6400020CE74B514B098B974B9C8C758000AC6B4BA85C801C7780020ACB0D22CB97C0020C2DCC791D5740020BCFCAE4C003F00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파라블레이즈끼리 싸우는 건 안 돼.\n파라블레이즈 대 카디나르마여야 한다고.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CB77CBE14B808C774C988B07CB9AC0020C2F8C6B0B2940020AC740020C5480020B3FC002E000AD30CB77CBE14B808C774C9880020B3000020CE74B514B098B974B9C8C5ECC57C0020D55CB2E4ACE0002E00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래... 이건 운명적인 결투니까\n네가 준비될 때까지 기다릴게.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798002E002E002E0020C774AC740020C6B4BA85C801C7780020ACB0D22CB2C8AE4C000AB124AC000020C900BE44B4200020B54CAE4CC9C00020AE30B2E4B9B4AC8C002E00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "드디어 파라블레이즈와 카디나르마의\n운명적인 결투를 할 수 있게 됐군.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그럼, 내가 생각한 최고의 시추에이션에서\n승부를 시작해 보자고.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
